          {
            "title": "require()",
            "id": 121535,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per usare Express, lo <em>importiamo</em> nel nostro codice usando la funzione integrata di Node <code>require</code>.</p><p>In genere assegniamo l'output di <code>require</code> a una variabile con lo stesso nome del pacchetto che stiamo usando.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"node\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>express</code>, seguito da <code>require</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per usare Express, lo <em>importiamo</em> nel nostro codice usando la funzione integrata di Node <code>require</code>.</p><p>Carica il pacchetto <code>express</code> e memorizzalo in una variabile con il nome del pacchetto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"import\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"node\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;node&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>express</code>, <code>require</code> e infine <code>\"express\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Express App",
            "id": 122143,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Creiamo un'app Express. Inizieremo creando una variabile denominata <code>app</code>.</p><p>All'interno della variabile memorizzeremo quindi l'output della funzione integrata <code>express</code> di Express.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>app</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>express</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Creiamo un'app Express. Inizieremo creando una variabile denominata <code>app</code>.</p><p>Nella variabile, memorizza il risultato della chiamata alla funzione integrata <code>express</code> di Express.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"server\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"create\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"listen\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>app</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>express</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Express Server",
            "id": 121537,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbiamo creato <code>app</code>, ma al momento non fa nulla. Facciamo in modo che ascolti le richieste in arrivo.</p><p>Per farlo, useremo la funzione integrata <code>listen</code> di Express.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>app</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>listen</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Express usa <code>listen</code> per accettare richieste in arrivo. Inizia la chiamata su <code>app</code>; aggiungerai poi la porta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"express\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"require\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"use\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"port\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>app</code>, seguito da <code>.</code>, <code>listen</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Two Parameters",
            "id": 121749,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione <code>listen</code> accetta due parametri. Il primo parametro specifica il <strong>numero di porta</strong>.</p><p>Il secondo parametro è una <strong>funzione di callback</strong> che viene eseguita quando il server si avvia.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"85\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>3000</code>, seguito da <code>() =&gt; {}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione <code>listen</code> accetta due parametri: un <strong>numero di porta</strong> e una <strong>funzione callback</strong> eseguita all'avvio del server.</p><p>Configura il server per usare la porta <code>3000</code> ed eseguire una callback vuota dopo l'avvio.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"8080\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function() {}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app.listen\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>3000</code>, seguito da <code>() =&gt; {}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "What is a Port?*",
            "id": 121540,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il numero di porta è un identificatore distintivo che indica al server quale applicazione deve elaborare una richiesta in arrivo.</p><p>Le porte consentono a più applicazioni di connettersi contemporaneamente a un server con richieste HTTP diverse.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>3000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un numero di porta identifica dove un’applicazione può ricevere richieste sul tuo computer.</p><p>Applicazioni diverse possono usare porte diverse sullo stesso computer.</p><p>Scegli la porta che permette all'app di accettare richieste su <code>3000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"8080\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"port\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"listen\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>3000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Port Number Variable",
            "id": 121538,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>È pratica comune assegnare il numero di porta a una variabile e poi passare quella variabile alla funzione <code>listen</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"gateway\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>port</code>, seguito da <code>3000</code> e infine <code>port</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>È pratica comune assegnare il numero di porta a una variabile e poi passare la variabile alla funzione <code>listen</code>.</p><p>Assegna una sola volta la porta <code>3000</code>, quindi usa la stessa variabile quando l'app inizia ad ascoltare.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"server\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3001\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"PORT\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>port</code>, seguito da <code>3000</code> e infine <code>port</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Console Log",
            "id": 121753,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando il server inizia ad ascoltare sulla porta specificata, viene attivata la funzione callback.</p><p>Usiamo la funzione di callback per visualizzare il numero di porta nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"151\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>() =&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>console.log</code> e infine <code>port</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando il server inizia ad ascoltare sulla porta specificata, viene attivata la funzione callback.</p><p>Nella callback, scrivi un normale log con <code>console.log</code> per confermare quale <code>port</code> è in esecuzione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"151\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.error\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"host\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>() =&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>console.log</code> e infine <code>port</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Express",
            "id": 121544,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché Express è utile?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché semplifica la configurazione, l'installazione e la gestione dei server web</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché aiuta gli sviluppatori a installare più velocemente i pacchetti Node</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché semplifica la configurazione, l'installazione e la gestione dei server web.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hai installato Express con NPM. Ora devi creare route e risposte del server. In che modo Express può aiutarti?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fornisce strumenti che semplificano la creazione e la gestione del web server.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Installa per te i pacchetti Node rimanenti.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Avvia solo il runtime JavaScript, lasciando invariata la configurazione del server.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fornisce strumenti che semplificano la creazione e la gestione del web server.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: require",
            "id": 121545,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è la funzione integrata di Node da utilizzare per utilizzare un pacchetto Node installato in un progetto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>require</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>use</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>require</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il pacchetto Express è installato, ma il file non può ancora usarlo. Quale funzione integrata di Node lo carica nel progetto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>require</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>install</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>use</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>require</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Express App",
            "id": 121546,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale funzione integrata di Express eseguiamo per creare un'istanza di un'app Express?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>express</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>useExpress</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>express</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo che <code>require(\"express\")</code> memorizza il pacchetto in <code>express</code>, quale chiamata crea l'istanza dell'app Express?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>express()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>useExpress()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>require()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>express()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
